      'The chapter 1 and chapter 3 lines are from the 2012 Destiny Image edition (Reclaiming God’s Original Purpose for Your Life, also published as God’s Big Idea); the p. ix and p. 12 lines stand in the same words in the 2010 edition. Obvious scanning errors (for example "ol" for "of") are corrected. His word for the adversary in the quoted chapter 1 line is lowercase in his own text. The Kingdom-as-colony picture is his illustration; the Word’s own words are kingdom, citizenship and ambassadors, and the lesson says so. His hope for "one culture throughout the entire created realm" is weighed against Revelation 7:9 and 21:24, which show the nations still distinct before the throne; that is a correction of that one phrase, not of his larger point. The summaries of his argument are marked as summary.',
